# Fleet cluster credentials — local only, NEVER commit (gitignored).
# Copy to clusters.csv and fill in per cluster from the RHDP order.
#
# Format: name,server,username,password[,token]
#   name     short label used in status output
#   server   cluster API URL (https://api.<cluster>:6443)
#   username RHDP kubeadmin (or another cluster-admin user)
#   password login password
#   token    optional bearer token — when present it takes precedence over
#            username/password (e.g. for SNOs that only expose tokens)
#
name,server,username,password,token
workshop-01,https://api.cluster-abc123.dyn.redhatworkshops.io:6443,kubeadmin,CHANGE-ME,
workshop-02,https://api.cluster-def456.dyn.redhatworkshops.io:6443,kubeadmin,CHANGE-ME,sha256~CHANGE-ME
